    {
      "chapter": "Slide-in keeper with positive retention",
      "duration_ms": 1800,
      "note": "The inverted U throat opens downward so the keeper drops over the neck from above. An accessible M3 x 40 socket screw secures it to a bottom-loaded trapped M3 nut in the jaw. The small fastener prevents lifting during handling; main forward thrust bypasses the keeper."
    },
