          "text": "2: Insert the M3 nut into the jaw from below. Place the wear nut in its housing; turn in the D screw."
        },
        "group": "drawing/annotate",
        "operation": "drawing_add_note"
      },
      "id": "vise_assembly_note_1"
    },
    {
      "call": {
        "arguments": {
          "position": [
            20.0,
            302.0
          ],
          "sheet_id": {
            "$ref": "vise_assembly_sheet_id",
            "pointer": ""
          },
          "text": "3: Slide the jaw onto the rails and over the screw head. Lower the keeper over the neck; fit the M3 screw from above."
        },
        "group": "drawing/annotate",
        "operation": "drawing_add_note"
      },
      "id": "vise_assembly_note_2"
    },
    {
      "call": {
        "arguments": {
          "position": [
            20.0,
            308.0
          ],
          "sheet_id": {
            "$ref": "vise_assembly_sheet_id",
            "pointer": ""
          },
          "text": "4: Check the full travel by hand before loading. Keep hands away from the jaw pinch region; use adult guidance."
        },
        "group": "drawing/annotate",
        "operation": "drawing_add_note"
      },
      "id": "vise_assembly_note_3"
    },
    {
      "call": {
        "arguments": {
          "position": [
            20.0,
            314.0
          ],
          "sheet_id": {
            "$ref": "vise_assembly_sheet_id",
            "pointer": ""
          },
          "text": "LOAD PATH: Closing thrust passes from screw head into the jaw shoulder, then through the workpiece to the fixed jaw and frame."
        },
        "group": "drawing/annotate",
        "operation": "drawing_add_note"
      },
      "id": "vise_assembly_note_4"
    },
    {
      "call": {
        "arguments": {
          "position": [
            20.0,
            320.0
          ],
          "sheet_id": {
            "$ref": "vise_assembly_sheet_id",
            "pointer": ""
          },
          "text": "SERVICE: Remove workpiece and unload. Remove the top M3 screw, lift keeper, slide jaw off, then unscrew the drive and lift the wear nut."
        },
        "group": "drawing/annotate",
        "operation": "drawing_add_note"
      },
      "id": "vise_assembly_note_5"
    },
    {
      "call": {
        "arguments": {
          "position": [
            20.0,
            326.0
          ],
          "sheet_id": {
            "$ref": "vise_assembly_sheet_id",
            "pointer": ""
          },
          "text": "The D thread has asymmetric contact. CAD motion and interference checks do not establish creep, wear or a clamping-force rating."
        },
        "group": "drawing/annotate",
        "operation": "drawing_add_note"
      },
      "id": "vise_assembly_note_6"
    },
    {
      "call": {
        "arguments": {
          "position": [
            20.0,
            332.0
          ],
          "sheet_id": {
            "$ref": "vise_assembly_sheet_id",
            "pointer": ""
          },
          "text": "A-A passes through the screw axis. Purchased hardware is shown as clearance envelopes; threads and sockets are not manufactured here."
        },
        "group": "drawing/annotate",
        "operation": "drawing_add_note"
      },
      "id": "vise_assembly_note_7"
    },
